  "ownFindings": [
    {
      "id": "HB-source-grade-boundary",
      "verdict": "KEEP",
      "reason": "The2006p35 general chemistry tasks support society/economy/environment context, but not exact coverage of the whole flocculation/corrosion/barrier/battery/degradation profile. The2022restrictionp3 moves the old energy and natural/synthetic-material topics into upper-secondary and retains a narrowed grades8/9 table. The annotation states these limits and does not use old grade10 bullets as current SekI whole credit."
    },
    {
      "id": "HB-course-columns",
      "verdict": "KEEP",
      "reason": "Original GyO2022p31 common rows include corrosion/protection and accumulator/environment discussion; Nernst/concentration dependence, redox titration, Faraday and overvoltage additions are labelled LK. P34 common material/sustainability evaluation is distinct from LK mechanism/nanotechnology. Own7f is a general chemical-function/societal-evaluation offer in the existing CrossStage GK/LK views; neither all LK additions nor every named context is asserted as a common official obligation."
    },
    {
      "id": "HB-practical-and-context-boundary",
      "verdict": "KEEP",
      "reason": "GyOp19 explicitly requires experiments with renewable-feedstock polymers and media research; p31 explicitly requires voltage-series experiments. Possible contexts, Vertiefungen and example experiments remain distinguishable from common competence rows. Paper cases perform none of these experiments or real research. The proposal execution boundary expressly retains this distinction."
    },
    {
      "id": "whole7f-P",
      "verdict": "KEEP",
      "reason": "Whole DE/EN profile requires chemical functions as well as societal benefit/limits and fresh transfer. Lower turbidity is not potable-water proof; corrosion coating benefits depend on proper function/residues. Biodegradability requires medium, organisms, moisture, temperature, oxygen/time and products; fragmentation is not mineralisation. Packaging barrier and deliberately permeable agricultural cover can legitimately require different transport behaviour. Neither a polymer name nor a battery example supplies full sustainability/product clearance. The cases support prospective bounded theory acquisition without requiring the history-of-chemistry goal188."
    },
    {
      "id": "whole5b1-P",
      "verdict": "KEEP AS UNCHANGED CONTEXT",
      "reason": "The genuine prerequisite teaches selecting/structuring/citing chemical information and separating advertisement from data. Equal250mL and five-minute comparisons retain reference conditions;200/Ng per use is not a life-cycle balance. The conditional own-search route preserves original source obligations without imposing BY-specific research on every HB use. Whole source materials and actual learner search/performance are not freshly certified here."
    },
    {
      "id": "authored-roles",
      "verdict": "KEEP",
      "reason": "Own stock-helper inspection confirms existing7f,5b1 and orientationa9 are target in both HB views. Only7f jurisdiction metadata and own-acquisition annotation change. 188-to7f remains removed;7f-to5b1-toa9 remains unchanged. a9 stays orientation with no invented P. Neither existing mastery nor independent selection is inferred."
    },
    {
      "id": "not-restoring-inferred-source-proof",
      "verdict": "KEEP",
      "reason": "The former reverse requiresClosure contribution from188 was compiler applicability evidence and cannot prove an official whole7f duty. Explicit own acquisition scope is an honest separate supported jurisdiction input for two existing targets. It does not reinstate the false dependency or delete target topics."
    }
